d exercise.","Most people **work** eight hours, **sleep** seven hours and **exercise** one hour. Only 10% **talk** to friends every day.","The study says: **Do** more with your friends!"],"kicker":"ACADEMIC SUMMARY","by":"Research Team","gloss":[["adult","adulto"],["habit","hábito"],["exercise","exercício"],["most","a maioria"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The study asks 200 adults.","ans":"T","why":"“200 adults.”"},{"q":"Most people sleep 4 hours.","ans":"F","why":"7 horas."},{"q":"10% talk to friends daily.","ans":"T","why":"“Only 10%.”"},{"q":"The study is from Brazil.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“habit” means…","opts":["hábito","hobby","doença"],"ans":0,"why":"habit = hábito."},{"q":"“most” means…","opts":["a maioria","a minoria","nenhum"],"ans":0,"why":"most = a maioria."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Present Simple questions","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta curta"],"rows":[["**Do you work?**","**Yes, I do. / No, I don’t.**"],["**Does she sleep?**","**Yes, she does. / No, she doesn’t.**"],["**What do you do?**","**I’m a teacher.**"]],"cap":"Do / Does"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"What do you do?","body":"Esta pergunta quer saber a **profissão**. Responda: *I’m a… / I work as a…*"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Depois de **does**, o verbo fica sem -s: *Does she **work**?*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ you work? — Yes, I ___ .","a":["Do","do"],"why":"you → Do / do."},{"s":"___ she sleep well?","a":"Does","why":"she → Does."},{"s":"What ___ you do?","a":"do","why":"What do you do?","say":"What do you do"},{"s":"Does he ___ ? (talk)","a":"talk","why":"Sem -s após does."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["adult","adulto"],["habit","hábito"],["exe